# Expense Tracker & Budget Manager - Comprehensive System Design Blueprint

## 1. System Architecture & Core Modules
The **Expense Tracker & Budget Manager** is designed using the MERN stack architecture (MongoDB, Express.js, React.js, Node.js) and is organized into 6 main functional modules[cite: 2]:

1. **User Management & Authentication**: Handles user registration, login, JWT token generation, password hashing, and user profile management[cite: 2].
2. **Category Management**: Enables creation, updating, and deletion of income and expense categories (both system defaults and custom user categories)[cite: 2].
3. **Expense Management**: Provides full CRUD (Create, Read, Update, Delete) operations for logging daily user expenses[cite: 2].
4. **Income Management**: Provides full CRUD operations for recording income transactions[cite: 2].
5. **Budget Management**: Allows users to set monthly category spending limits and monitor real-time usage and thresholds[cite: 2].
6. **Dashboard & Analytical Reports**: Aggregates financial data into interactive pie/bar charts, summary indicators, and monthly financial performance reports[cite: 2].

