## 2. MongoDB Database Collection Schemas

### Collection 1: `Users`
- `_id`: ObjectId (Primary Key)
- `name`: String (Required)
- `email`: String (Required, Unique)
- `password`: String (Hashed via bcrypt, Required)[cite: 2]
- `role`: String (Enum: ['Admin', 'User'], Default: 'User')[cite: 2]
- `createdAt`: Date

### Collection 2: `Categories`
- `_id`: ObjectId (Primary Key)
- `name`: String (Required)
- `type`: String (Enum: ['income', 'expense'], Required)
- `user`: ObjectId (Ref: 'Users', null for default system categories)[cite: 2]
- `createdAt`: Date

### Collection 3: `Expenses`
- `_id`: ObjectId (Primary Key)
- `title`: String (Required)
- `amount`: Number (Required)
- `category`: ObjectId (Ref: 'Categories', Required)[cite: 2]
- `user`: ObjectId (Ref: 'Users', Required)[cite: 2]
- `date`: Date (Default: Date.now)
- `notes`: String

### Collection 4: `Incomes`
- `_id`: ObjectId (Primary Key)
- `title`: String (Required)
- `amount`: Number (Required)
- `category`: ObjectId (Ref: 'Categories', Required)[cite: 2]
- `user`: ObjectId (Ref: 'Users', Required)[cite: 2]
- `date`: Date (Default: Date.now)
- `notes`: String

### Collection 5: `Budgets`
- `_id`: ObjectId (Primary Key)
- `user`: ObjectId (Ref: 'Users', Required)[cite: 2]
- `category`: ObjectId (Ref: 'Categories', Required)[cite: 2]
- `limitAmount`: Number (Required)
- `month`: Number (1-12, Required)
- `year`: Number (Required)
- `createdAt`: Date

