## 3. Entity Relationship Diagram (ERD)

### Multiplicity & Key Relationships
- **User to Income**: 1-to-Many (`1 User` creates `N Income` records)[cite: 2].
- **User to Expense**: 1-to-Many (`1 User` creates `N Expense` records)[cite: 2].
- **User to Category**: 1-to-Many (`1 User` creates `N Custom Categories`)[cite: 2].
- **User to Budget**: 1-to-Many (`1 User` configures `N Monthly Budgets`)[cite: 2].
- **Category to Expense**: 1-to-Many (`1 Category` classifies `N Expenses`)[cite: 2].
- **Category to Income**: 1-to-Many (`1 Category` classifies `N Incomes`)[cite: 2].
- **Category to Budget**: 1-to-1 or 1-to-Many (`1 Category` targets `Budget Limits` per month)[cite: 2].

